 uctions and use Assignment 2 Answer Sheet. Re-read methods and supplied 
 conclusions for the five test-yourself studies. For correlations\, consi
 der reverse causality and third-variable explanations\; for experiments\
 , consider confounding variables. Complete the answer sheet independentl
 y and submit it to the D2L Assignment 2 dropbox. Extension requests go t
 o your assigned TA\, require verified ACR or applicable accommodations\,
  and allow at most 7 days\; regular late penalty is 5% per day thereafte
 r\, with no submissions accepted after two weeks from original due date.
